"title":"Honest Thief","title_en":null,"title_fr":"The Good Criminal","original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"تدور الأحداث في إطار الأكشن الممزوج بالإثارة والتشويق، حول اللص المحترف توم، الذي يسرق عدة بنوك، ويخفي الأموال، وعندما يقع في حب صديقته آني، يقرر بدء حياة جديدة، ولكن يصطدم بعراقيل الماضي ومصائبه.","description_en":"A bank robber tries to turn himself in because he's falling in love and wants to live an honest life...but when he realizes the Feds are more corrupt than him, he must fight back to clear his name.","description_fr":"Tom, un légendaire voleur de banque,  décide de se ranger et passe un deal, contre son immunité, avec le FBI qui n’a jamais réussi à lui mettre la main dessus. Il réalise vite que les Fédéraux ont un autre plan en tête : partager son butin et le faire accuser d’un meurtre. Pris au piège, pourchassé par la police et le FBI, il décide de reprendre les choses en main et se lance dans une vengeance explosive.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeD4PabP6099gpE0STWJrJrCBCs.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2M2JxEv3HSpjnZWjY9NOdGgfUd.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.4,"vote_count":1976,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2020","release_date":"2020-09-03","runtime_minutes":99,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["إثارة","حركة","جريمة","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["thriller","action","crime"],"similar":["mv811592","mv14194","mv2207","mv617502","mv9257","mv972313","mv463905","mv1030987"],"director":"مارك ويليامز","cast":[{"name":"ليام نيسون","character":"Tom Dolan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sRLev3wJioBgun3ZoeAUFpkLy0D.jpg"},{"name":"Kate Walsh","character":"Annie Wilkins","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jRg4pmjvI2063YnQ6PJidclOc4L.jpg"},{"name":"جاي كورتني","character":"John Nivens","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6vEaNwbOKov6yzQx15CdtrqfK3L.jpg"},{"name":"Jeffrey Donovan","character":"Sean Meyers","profile_image":"https